t seeds indoors about 6 weeks before transplanting to the garden. Think of onions as a leaf crop, not a root crop. When planting onion sets, don't bury them more than 1 inch under the soil. For sets or transplants, space plants 4 to 5 inches apart in rows 12 to 18 inches apart.\n\nCredit : Media Plan and Gite Masdescombes and nitk7731\n\nIf you are the owner, please send me a email or comment on the video. I will follow your request as soon as i read. \n\n Please comment below , Which Cultivation and Farming video you need to watch ?\r\n\r\n❤  SUBSCRIBE TODAY  ❥  SUBSCRIBE  ❥  SUBSCRIBE NOW  ❤\r\n\rYouTube -:    / completepicturesofficial  \ntwitter :   / completepics   \n\nIf you enjoyed watching subscribe for a new video every week.\r\nSubscribe: http://goo.gl/Wvp7qV\nwatch :  Dry Fruits Processing Technology -    • Video  \nGarlic Cultivation :    • Garlic Cultivation Process from Garlic far...  ","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":55,"length":12,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CB4Q040EGAYiEwi-qb6A7L6SAxWjkTcIHVUPDbXKAQSW0jQ8","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=6aCleihLoDA\u0026pp=0gcJCR0AztywvtLA","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"6aCleihLoDA","startTimeSeconds":0,"playerParams":"0gcJCR0AztywvtLA","watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr6---sn-8pgbpohxqp5-aigez.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026ofpcc=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=e9a0a57a284ba030\u0026ip=86.22.245.11\u0026initcwndbps=3960000\u0026mt=1770173863\u0026oweuc=\u0026pxtags=Cg4KAnR4Egg1MTY5MTAyOA\u0026rxtags=Cg4KAnR4Egg1MTY5MTAyNw%2CCg4KAnR4Egg1MTY5MTAyOA"}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"YouTube Channel Link: Video"}}},{"startIndex":850,"length":31,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingP